{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, Margaret returns to the house consumed by flames.<br>She tries to piece together her forgotten memories\u2014only to realize the memories are consuming her instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>The childhood home doesn\u2019t welcome you.</strong><br>Somehow, Margaret finds herself back in the old house that burned down years ago.<br>Footsteps echo at the end of the hallway. A smile she doesn\u2019t remember appears in the mirror.<br>In the attic, a locked room waits for her name.<br>Your job: piece the memories together, reveal the truth\u2014and don\u2019t die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/b6794312510833f89bb077b3291b098b.avif?t=1762324233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/b6794312510833f89bb077b3291b098b.avif?t=1762324233 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Fear can breathe.</strong><br>Don\u2019t blink. Don\u2019t look back. Don\u2019t speak too loud.<br>Because <i>it</i> is listening\u2014really.<br>It creeps closer, softly breathing, waiting for that moment you turn around...<br>(Just don\u2019t play too late at night.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1762324233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1762324233 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Clues, puzzles, fragments.</strong><br>Every corner hides something\u2014sometimes a clue, sometimes a trap.<br>Old photos, burnt letters, broken dolls\u2014all whisper stories.<br>Use them wisely\u2026 or summon something you\u2019ll regret meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/c19ce1d7832f31e64495ea2854b2132b.avif?t=1762324233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/c19ce1d7832f31e64495ea2854b2132b.avif?t=1762324233 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e <strong>The dolls remember you.</strong><br>In <i>Doll\u2019s House</i>, you\u2019re not telling the story\u2014the story is telling you.<br>Sometimes the dolls just stare.<br>Sometimes, they want you to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/6d2bcfef4125136c3a76a9aea228cdd0.avif?t=1762324233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/6d2bcfef4125136c3a76a9aea228cdd0.avif?t=1762324233 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134470?t=1762324233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134470?t=1762324233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/5746f5dc4fdeae0eda6b76e4b2f7cd22e797fdbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762324233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/5746f5dc4fdeae0eda6b76e4b2f7cd22e797fdbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762324233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years 